crates/axio-quota

The provider protocol knowledge in this crate — which file each vendor's CLI
writes its credentials to, which endpoint reports usage, what those responses
contain, and the defensive parsing they require — was derived by reading
CodexBar by Peter Steinberger (https://github.com/steipete/codexbar), MIT
licensed.

No CodexBar source is included. The crate is an independent Rust implementation
and shares no lines with it. The attribution is recorded because the knowledge,
not the code, was the expensive part.

