crates/axio-cost

Which file each coding agent writes its session transcript to, and what those
transcripts contain, was derived by reading tokscale by Junho Yeo
(https://github.com/junhoyeo/tokscale), MIT licensed.

No tokscale source is included. The crate is an independent Rust implementation
and shares no lines with it. Every token-accounting rule in it was additionally
verified against real transcripts on the machine it was written on, and several
differ from what a reading of tokscale alone would have produced.
